意外 馬鞍山昂平 十年前馮盈盈安全示範滑翔傘必需要教練同行（圖片來源：YouTube@umoviegroup）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179421049269046066_15145408956af17abd8334a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>十年前馮盈盈安全示範滑翔傘必需要教練同行（圖片來源：YouTube@umoviegroup）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%bb%91%e7%bf%94%e5%82%98%e6%84%8f%e5%a4%96/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">滑翔傘意外</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%a6%ac%e9%9e%8d%e5%b1%b1%e6%98%82%e5%b9%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">馬鞍山昂平</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%b6%b2%e4%b8%8a%e8%87%aa%e5%ad%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">網上自學</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a%e8%a9%b1%e9%a1%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">旅遊話題</a>\nNov 9 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.159861+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1147,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T07:48:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:31.918671+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:31.918671+00:00","content_hash":"b695ad4c39ec97cbc231ddc875eb52863a19f09fbf825459cd377803d5086311","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}